  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"876\" height=\"285\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"789\" height=\"127\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Advanced Peripherals 是一個為 CC:Tweaked（Computercraft）新增許多實用擴充功能的模組。<br>本模組旨在加入過去在 PeripheralsPlusOne 或 Plethora 等模組的舊版 Minecraft 中即可使用的功能。<br>透過 Advanced Peripherals，你僅需使用聊天訊息就能控制你在 Minecraft 中的<br>基地，<br>或是透過我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.advanced-peripherals.de%252fintegrations%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組整合</a>&nbsp;<br>來操控你夢寐以求的模組！<br>也可以隨心所欲地修改世界！&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">有了 CC:Tweaked（Computercraft）與 Advanced Peripherals，<br>你的創作將毫無限制。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span><span>如果你想支持我，可以透過&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srendi\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 贊助。不過，任何形式的支持都能激勵我！</span></span> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"122\"><br>如果需要幫助，請加入 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你有建議或發現問題，請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Seniorendi/AdvancedPeripherals\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上告訴我們！<br><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Information.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"119\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增內容</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Advanced Peripherals 是一個功能豐富的模組。<br>完整列表請參閱我們的文件。<br><br>所有文件的連結：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.intelligence-modding.de</a><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>規劃中的功能</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">規劃中的功能清單很長。你可以在這裡看到部分（非全部）功能：<a href=\"https://github.com/Seniorendi/AdvancedPeripherals/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果你有建議，也可以在此提出。<br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>影片</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">歡迎自行製作關於此模組的影片。<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>toastonrye 製作的教學<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vegXpliPFhA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><br>0.7r 更新日誌</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tIpBTgSkWr0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>範例</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們提供許多搭配簡單腳本的機能範例。請查看文件以了解詳細內容<br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">文件</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們為你準備了完整的說明手冊！你可以點此 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往</a> 瀏覽！<br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmyftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://intelligence-modding.de/images/MyFTB_Full.png\" alt=\"MyFTB\" width=\"980\" height=\"392\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">正在尋找全新且充滿挑戰的冒險旅程嗎？<br>夢想著機器、發電廠、魔法甚至蜜蜂嗎？<br>MyFTB 是德國最大的模組化 Minecraft 伺服器網路。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">單一世界不夠玩！因此每位玩家在這裡都能擁有自己的獨立世界。<br>可單獨遊玩或組隊進行，享受極致的彈性與安全性，帶來最棒的遊戲樂趣。<br>超過 20 款模組整合包，保證能找到適合你的那一款！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>歡迎瀏覽他們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmyftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a>、<a href=\"https://discord.gg/myftb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flauncher.myftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">啟動器</a><br>在 MyFTB 啟動器中，你總是能取得正確的模組整合包版本以在我們的伺服器上遊玩。此外，伺服器進度會自動儲存！<br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用方法：</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果你願意，可以在任何模組整合包中使用此模組。</span></p>",
